WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.609 --> 00:00:18.391
and Quinn hurried over to where all the riders were gathering.

2
00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:24.816
It was time for Coach Adams to announce the new Blue Demons team.

3
00:00:25.937 --> 00:00:27.658
The coach stood holding a clipboard.

4
00:00:28.338 --> 00:00:30.200
He congratulated all the riders.

5
00:00:31.536 --> 00:00:35.498
"Everyone had great rides today, despite the surprise track change.

6
00:00:36.278 --> 00:00:37.719
You should all be proud of yourselves.

7
00:00:38.399 --> 00:00:43.281
Now, as you know, the fastest two boys and girls in each division will be invited to join

8
00:00:43.321 --> 00:00:44.962
this year's Blue Demons team.

9
00:00:45.902 --> 00:00:48.703
Will the following riders, please come forward?

10
00:00:49.363 --> 00:00:57.887
For the junior division After Coach Adams announced Riley's name, the first thing Riley heard was Jordan cheering

11
00:00:57.947 --> 00:01:02.317
loudly. "Yay!

12
00:01:02.337 --> 00:01:03.618
Go, Riley!"

13
00:01:03.678 --> 00:01:04.118
Mr. and Mrs.

14
00:01:04.198 --> 00:01:08.821
Clark looked happy too, clapping like mad as Riley made her way through the crowd.

15
00:01:08.841 --> 00:01:12.423
"I did it!

16
00:01:13.224 --> 00:01:14.324
I'm a Blue Demon!"

17
00:01:15.085 --> 00:01:15.785
Riley thought.

18
00:01:16.426 --> 00:01:22.609
Thrilled, she took her place beside Coach Adams as Delaney handed her an official Blue Demons jersey.

19
00:01:25.371 --> 00:01:31.067
Riley was so excited, she didn't realize that the next name Coach Adams called wasn't Quinn's name.

20
00:01:32.348 --> 00:01:36.711
She didn't think about Quinn until a younger girl named Shavetta appeared beside Riley.

21
00:01:36.731 --> 00:01:39.773
"I'm a Blue Demon!

22
00:01:40.213 --> 00:01:41.534
I'm a Blue Demon!"

23
00:01:42.195 --> 00:01:43.776
Shavetta yelled with excitement.

24
00:01:44.857 --> 00:01:47.378
Riley looked back toward where Quinn had been standing.

25
00:01:48.719 --> 00:01:50.681
But the other girl was no longer there.

26
00:01:52.482 --> 00:01:59.111
After all the new team members had been announced, the Blue Demons team gathered together, high-fiving one another.

27
00:01:59.131 --> 00:02:03.254
"Welcome to the Blue Demons!"

28
00:02:03.855 --> 00:02:04.776
Coach Adams said.

29
00:02:04.796 --> 00:02:09.720
"To celebrate our new team, we're going to Tony's Pizza Place for lunch.

30
00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:12.442
Everyone, bring your families and meet us there!"

31
00:02:13.443 --> 00:02:15.644
Riley knew that her family would join the team.

32
00:02:16.445 --> 00:02:19.768
They'd gone to the pizza party each year that Jordan had made the team.

33
00:02:20.908 --> 00:02:22.069
Sure enough, Mr.

34
00:02:22.109 --> 00:02:22.490
and Mrs.

35
00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:27.665
Clark were already packing up the folding chairs, and Jordan was heading to the parking lot with some

36
00:02:27.725 --> 00:02:28.585
other Blue Demons.

37
00:02:32.586 --> 00:02:34.326
Riley went over to Coach Adams.

38
00:02:34.346 --> 00:02:37.447
"That's too bad about Quinn," she said.

39
00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:39.588
"She's a good rider.

40
00:02:40.148 --> 00:02:41.448
I thought she'd make the team."

41
00:02:41.468 --> 00:02:47.930
"I think her overall time was about three seconds behind yours," the coach replied.

42
00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:51.451
"Shavetta Jackson had the best overall time."

43
00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:53.952
"Oh Thanks, Coach."

44
00:02:54.728 --> 00:02:58.569
As Riley walked away, she realized that she felt disappointed.

45
00:02:58.589 --> 00:03:04.251
"But why should you feel bad that Quinn hadn't made the team?"

46
00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:05.631
she asked herself.

47
00:03:06.491 --> 00:03:11.413
Quinn hadn't been very nice to Riley, and Riley had fought really hard to win a spot on

48
00:03:11.453 --> 00:03:12.193
the Blue Demons.

49
00:03:13.153 --> 00:03:14.754
But Quinn had worked hard too.

50
00:03:15.634 --> 00:03:17.434
Somehow it just didn't seem fair.

51
00:03:18.414 --> 00:03:21.975
Riley suddenly spied Quinn sitting on a curb in the parking area.

52
00:03:22.876 --> 00:03:27.053
She was alone, still smeared with mud, her duffel bag beside her.

53
00:03:28.354 --> 00:03:30.695
Her bike lay in the grass, spattered with dirt.

54
00:03:32.376 --> 00:03:34.937
"So much for that shiny bike," Riley thought.

55
00:03:35.957 --> 00:03:37.057
She walked over to Quinn.

56
00:03:39.879 --> 00:03:42.960
"Sorry you didn't make the team," she said softly.

57
00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:45.121
Quinn glanced up.

58
00:03:45.821 --> 00:03:47.362
She looked as if she'd been crying.

59
00:03:48.622 --> 00:03:52.684
She wiped her nose with the back of her sleeve, leaving a smear of dirt on her face.

60
00:03:54.484 --> 00:03:56.485
"It's my fault," she muttered.

61
00:03:56.505 --> 00:04:00.827
"Like I said before, great bike but dumb rider."

62
00:04:00.847 --> 00:04:04.709
"I bet you can make the team next year," Riley said.

63
00:04:05.729 --> 00:04:06.409
Quinn shrugged.

64
00:04:06.429 --> 00:04:10.991
"Maybe." Just then a tall shadow blocked the sun.

65
00:04:12.312 --> 00:04:17.454
Coach Hopewell, the head coach from the Racing Raptors, stood there, looking down at them.

66
00:04:17.474 --> 00:04:21.576
"That was a great ride, Quinn," he said.

67
00:04:22.332 --> 00:04:25.094
"I was very impressed with your speed and grit on the track."

68
00:04:25.114 --> 00:04:26.815
"Thanks, Coach."

69
00:04:27.416 --> 00:04:28.396
Quinn brightened a little.

70
00:04:28.416 --> 00:04:30.978
"I really did do my best out there today."

71
00:04:32.099 --> 00:04:33.520
She glanced quickly at Riley.

72
00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.342
"Though I made some dumb mistakes too."

73
00:04:36.362 --> 00:04:40.965
"I just had a chat with Coach Adams about you," Coach Hopewell went on.

74
00:04:40.985 --> 00:04:45.748
"Coach Adams is very disappointed that you didn't qualify for the Blue Demons.

75
00:04:46.969 --> 00:04:52.072
So, when I suggested that I offer you a spot on the Racing Raptors, he thought it was

76
00:04:52.092 --> 00:04:52.733
a good idea."

77
00:04:54.034 --> 00:04:56.115
"What?" Quinn's eyes grew round.

78
00:04:56.135 --> 00:05:00.537
"Did you just say I can join the Racing Raptors?"

79
00:05:02.178 --> 00:05:03.099
The coach smiled.

80
00:05:03.119 --> 00:05:05.020
"That's what I said.

81
00:05:06.201 --> 00:05:09.182
One of my junior riders is moving, and I have an open slot.

82
00:05:09.723 --> 00:05:12.704
That is, if you're interested in joining the team."

83
00:05:12.724 --> 00:05:15.266
"Of course I am!"

84
00:05:15.826 --> 00:05:16.526
Quinn cried.

85
00:05:16.546 --> 00:05:18.828
"Thank you so much, Coach!"

86
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:23.823
Coach Hopewell dug in his bag and pulled out a black-and-gold jersey.

87
00:05:23.843 --> 00:05:28.826
"Welcome to the team," he said.

88
00:05:28.846 --> 00:05:31.488
"Practice is on this track next week.

89
00:05:32.168 --> 00:05:32.869
I'll see you then."

90
00:05:32.889 --> 00:05:38.633
"Wow! Congratulations," Riley said as the coach left.

91
00:05:38.653 --> 00:05:40.314
"That was amazing!"

92
00:05:40.334 --> 00:05:42.115
"It sure was.

93
00:05:42.135 --> 00:05:44.397
I can't believe that just happened!"

94
00:05:44.977 --> 00:05:45.618
Quinn yelped.

95
00:05:46.658 --> 00:05:49.929
"You and your parents should come for pizza with us," Riley said.

96
00:05:49.949 --> 00:05:54.031
"Coach Adams won't mind, and you definitely need to celebrate."

97
00:05:55.533 --> 00:05:56.533
Quinn glanced away.

98
00:05:56.553 --> 00:05:59.175
"Nah," she said quickly.

99
00:05:59.195 --> 00:06:03.638
"My aunt is picking me up in a little while, and we have to go straight to her

100
00:06:03.678 --> 00:06:05.319
house." "Oh.

101
00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:07.741
Didn't your parents come to watch you ride?"

102
00:06:08.342 --> 00:06:12.164
For the first time Riley realized that Quinn's parents were nowhere around.

103
00:06:13.205 --> 00:06:17.248
From the look on Quinn's face, Riley was immediately sorry she'd said something.

104
00:06:18.592 --> 00:06:21.273
"My parents aren't here," Quinn said quickly.

105
00:06:21.293 --> 00:06:24.295
"My dad's away on business, and my mom's got stuff to do.

106
00:06:25.435 --> 00:06:27.156
She's usually pretty busy on the weekends."

107
00:06:27.176 --> 00:06:31.658
"Well, I still think you should celebrate," Riley said.

108
00:06:31.678 --> 00:06:35.960
"I have an idea—would your aunt let you come with my family?"

109
00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:40.062
"Uh Quinn hesitated.

110
00:06:40.082 --> 00:06:42.503
"Maybe," she said.

111
00:06:42.523 --> 00:06:44.064
"I'll text her now."

112
00:06:45.212 --> 00:06:48.634
Riley told her parents what was going on while Quinn texted her aunt.

113
00:06:48.654 --> 00:06:53.115
"My aunt said yes," Quinn said, running up to Riley and her family.

114
00:06:53.135 --> 00:06:55.717
"If you guys can drive me home afterward?"

115
00:06:55.737 --> 00:06:58.118
"Not a problem," Mr.

116
00:06:58.158 --> 00:06:58.718
Clark said.

117
00:06:58.738 --> 00:07:03.080
"Let's get going, both of you, or there won't be any pepperoni pizza left."

118
00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:08.022
"I don't get it, Riley," Quinn said as they crossed the parking lot together.

119
00:07:08.042 --> 00:07:12.664
"I haven't been very nice to you.

120
00:07:13.648 --> 00:07:15.429
So why are you being so nice to me?"

121
00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:17.871
Riley smiled.

122
00:07:17.891 --> 00:07:20.153
"I'm not sure," she admitted.

123
00:07:20.173 --> 00:07:26.837
"But I do know something: the Racing Raptors and the Blue Demons race each other all the time.

124
00:07:28.038 --> 00:07:32.901
And my new mission in life is to smoke you every time!"

125
00:07:34.022 --> 00:07:34.803
Quinn grinned.

126
00:07:34.823 --> 00:07:37.264
"Well, be prepared for disappointment.

127
00:07:37.585 --> 00:07:40.547
You will soon come to fear me—I promise you that."

128
00:07:40.567 --> 00:07:42.228
"Oh yeah?"

129
00:07:42.788 --> 00:07:43.609
Riley laughed.

130
00:07:43.629 --> 00:07:45.950
"Haven't you heard?

131
00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:48.472
I eat fear for breakfast!"
